### =====================================================
### Delete Users (batch) - Test Cases (WD-1433)
### =====================================================

### Test 1: Deactivate two users
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/deleteUsers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "users": [
    "user1@example.com",
    "user2@example.com"
  ]
}

### Test 2: Error - Empty list (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/deleteUsers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "users": []
}

### Test 3: Sin token de autorización → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/deleteUsers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "users": [
    "user1@example.com"
  ]
}
